      "content": "That makes sense, so it's basically about the stability of the crystal structure. But I've been really careful with my temperatures. Even when I'm precise, I feel like it shows up almost like it's... I don't know, like it's just popping up out of nowhere or like something is messing with the batch. Is there any environmental factor I'm missing that could cause this sudden bloom?",
